---
title: Lantern glazed roots
servings: 4
---

= Glaze

Warm @olive oil{2%tbsp} in a #pan{} and soften @minced garlic{2%cloves} with @Minced garlic{1%clove}(for the sauce) until golden. -- the second clove goes in late
Whisk in @balsamic{2%tbsp} and a splash of @balsamic, then season with @salt and @pepper.

= Roots

Toss @carrots{3} and @?peeled garlic{3} in the glaze, [- the roots can
sit overnight -] then roast for ~{40%minutes}.
Finish with @evoo{1%tbsp} and @moonberry jam{1%jar} if you have it.
